# Re-IPL GPC1 inside a RESTORED vehicle.  Seen 2026-09-19: the IPL read
# got no words at all from the mass memory ("carries no bootstrap"), where
# the same tape boots in a fresh simulation.  For a restored 2-GPC vehicle
# (snapshot201) via ~/workspace/pass-run/synctest.sh.
wait gpc 1 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+0     gpc 1
+2     mode HALT
+2     source MM1
+1     ipl
+5     mode STANDBY
